        url: "https://lastreetnames.com/street/colyton-street/" },
      { title: "George Garrigues, What Ever Became of Those Old L.A. City Streets? — “Carolina St., bet. Palmetto & E. 4th St., is part of S. Hewitt St. (13)”",
